<h4>{{ 'Help Panel — Links & Visibility'|trans }}</h4>
<div class="card mb-4">
  <div class="card-body">
    <p class="text-muted small mb-3">{{ 'Each item can be shown/hidden and its URL & label customised.'|trans }}</p>
